subckt tx_cp_timing_pdk110_78 (ref enable reset pulse vdd vss)
XI (ref refb vdd vss) pll_inv_pdk110_7
XR (reset resetb vdd vss) pll_inv_pdk110_7
XE (enable refb ref resetb en_hold vdd vss) tx_latch_r_pdk110_60
XD0 (ref d1 vdd vss) pll_inv_pdk110_79
XD1 (d1 d2 vdd vss) pll_inv_pdk110_79
XD2 (d2 d3 vdd vss) pll_inv_pdk110_79
